{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaRdtzeR1FyZWm9eaDdk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I replaced the `sorry` in `Main.lean` with a proof by induction on `m`. `lean Main.lean` exits with status 0 and prints no errors or warnings.\n\n```lean\ndef plus : Nat → Nat → Nat\n  | n, 0 => n\n  | n, m + 1 => plus n m + 1\n\ntheorem plus_eq_add (n m : Nat) : plus n m = n + m := by\n  induction m with\n  | zero => rfl\n  | succ m ih =>\n    show plus n m + 1 = n + (m + 1)\n    rw [ih]\n    rfl\n```\n\n- **Base case (`m = 0`):** `plus n 0` reduces to `n` by definition, so `rfl` closes it.\n- **Step case (`m + 1`):** `show` restates the goal in the unfolded form, `rw [ih]` replaces `plus n m` with `n + m`, and the final `rfl` closes `n + m + 1 = n + (m + 1)`, which holds by definition of `Nat.add`.\n\nI did not commit the change."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":856,"cache_read_input_tokens":8657,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":856},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b0915c1-a91f-47b9-8c77-190b30afcc55","uuid":"1eb63a7f-e663-4864-a593-94723fead866","timestamp":"2026-10-31T13:52:35.627Z","request_id":"req_011CgaRdtimodSUccvrmdAKk"}
